  "body": "Privately positioned up a long driveway, this tidy and well-presented one-bedroom unit offers a peaceful and secure environment, complemented by great neighbours. Bathed in morning sun, the open-plan living creates a warm and inviting space, while a covered rear area provides a private and cosy spot for entertaining year-round. Ideal for singles or a smart addition to any investment\r\nportfolio, the location is a standout-just a short stroll to Kohimarama Beach and with easy access to public transport nearby.\r\n\r\n- Private and up a long driveway\r\n- Tidy, well-presented one-bedroom unit \r\n- Open-plan living with morning sun   \r\n- Peaceful, secure setting with friendly neighbours \r\n- Ideal for singles or investors \r\n- Covered outdoor area for private, cosy entertaining\r\n- Walking distance to Kohimarama Beach\r\n- Easy access to bus transport nearby",
